// DIO
// Table: _Measures
// Display folder: Category\03 Ratios\Efficiency;Pages\02 Liquidity
// Format: #,##0.0
// Hidden: false
// Days inventory outstanding: Period Days × Average Inventory / Cost of Revenue. Period Days is the filing duration (not a fixed 365).

DIO =
DIVIDE([Period Days] * [Average Inventory], [Cost of Revenue])
